    "点房间角落的猫咪头像，说“去沙发上躺着”或“过来”。识别只在这台设备上进行，不录音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the cat’s head in the corner of the room and say “go lie on the sofa” or “come here”. Speech is recognised only on this device; nothing is recorded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点房间角落的猫咪头像，说“去沙发上躺着”或“过来”。识别只在这台设备上进行，不录音。"
          }
        }
      }
